a and reflects the region’s rapid urbanization and technological advancement. Designed by the architectural firm Takenaka Corporation, Abeno Harukas is not just a structural feat but also a multifunctional space, housing a hotel, department store, and art museum, thereby integrating commerce, culture, and leisure within its walls.

